dshjieqi-card README · 方式三：手动安装（不需要 git）：~~~json
   {
     "dependencies": {
       "dshjieqi-card": "link:C:/Users/<你的用户名>/.dsh/plugins/dshjieqi-card"
     },
     "dsh": {
       "profile": {
         "bundles": [
           "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
           "dshjieqi-card"
         ]
       }
     }
   }
   ~~~

3. 在 **%USERPROFILE%\.dsh\profiles\desktop\cordis.patch.yml** 末尾追加：

~~~yaml
   - insert:
       - id: jieqi
         name: dshjieqi-card
   ~~~

